  "characterDescription": "A clean, utilitarian sticky navigation with restrained typography and fluid responsive sizing — precision-engineered for a product-focused SaaS brand. Its mega-dropdown architecture, accessibility-first skip-link, and mode-switcher controls signal a developer-centric product with disciplined, functional design intent."
